"二类观察回调／反弹是否获得支撑或压力。本 App 结合回调笔长度和此前多次转折的重叠区间识别，具体依据见上方说明与学习词条。" = "Type 2 examines support or resistance during a retrace. The app considers stroke length and overlapping ranges of earlier turning points. See the signal description and lesson for details.";
