"中枢仍在延伸，区间可能继续变化。" = " The pivot is still extending; its range may change.";
"从底分型走到顶分型，中间隔着足够多的K线，才算一笔向上笔。笔是缠论里最小的一段走势，买卖点都落在笔的端点上。" = "From a bottom fractal to a top fractal with enough candles in between — that makes an up stroke. A stroke is the smallest unit of trend in Chan theory; buy/sell points sit at stroke ends.";
"从顶分型走到底分型，中间隔着足够多的K线，才算一笔向下笔。笔是缠论里最小的一段走势，买卖点都落在笔的端点上。" = "From a top fractal to a bottom fractal with enough candles in between — that makes a down stroke. A stroke is the smallest unit of trend in Chan theory; buy/sell points sit at stroke ends.";
