"连续三条线段的重叠区间：ZG 取各段高点中最低的，ZD 取各段低点中最高的。价格在区间里来回是震荡，离开区间并回抽不回才形成趋势。" = "The overlap of three consecutive segments: ZG is the lowest of their highs, ZD the highest of their lows. Moving inside is consolidation; a trend forms when price leaves and the pullback stays out.";
"连续三笔的重叠区间：ZG 取各笔高点中最低的，ZD 取各笔低点中最高的。价格在区间里来回是震荡，离开区间并回抽不回才形成趋势。" = "The overlap of three consecutive strokes: ZG is the lowest of their highs, ZD the highest of their lows. Moving inside is consolidation; a trend forms when price leaves and the pullback stays out.";
