"颜色：红=买点，绿=卖点；深浅=信号强弱（弱/中/强），越强越深，与详情页同一套判定。" = "Color: red = buy, green = sell; shade = signal strength (weak/medium/strong), darker is stronger, judged the same way as on the details page.";
"大小：买卖点类型，一类最小、三类最大——越往后确认程度越高。" = "Size: signal type — type 1 smallest, type 3 largest; later types are more confirmed.";
"新鲜度：按信号出现后的交易日数算（周末、休市不算），当天最高，第 5 个交易日归零，之后退场。" = "Freshness: counted in trading days since the signal appeared (weekends and holidays excluded); highest on the day, zero on the 5th trading day, then it leaves the radar.";
"未确认的信号（落在最后一笔上的提前预判）：类型确定性和强弱两部分打 6 折，新鲜度不打折。" = "Unconfirmed signals (early calls on the last, still-open stroke): the type-certainty and strength parts are discounted to 60%; freshness is not.";
