"市场雷达基于公开行情数据，按缠论结构规则自动识别并汇总所选指数成分股的买卖点形态，供技术分析研究使用。" = "The Market Radar uses Chan-theory structure rules on public market data to identify and aggregate buy/sell patterns among the constituents of the selected index, for technical-analysis research.";
"本功能展示的内容均为按标准缠论技术分析规则得出的结果，不构成任何投资建议、证券推荐或买卖要约。" = "All content shown is derived from standard Chan-theory technical analysis rules and does not constitute investment advice, a securities recommendation, or an offer to buy or sell.";
"每个买卖点都只是缠论对价格结构的一次孤立观测，是否值得操作需要你自己结合基本面、其他技术面和市场环境综合判断。" = "Each buy/sell point is just one isolated observation of price structure under Chan theory. Whether it's worth acting on is for you to judge, combining fundamentals, other technical factors, and the overall market environment.";
"气泡的颜色、深浅与大小分别表示信号方向、形态强弱与买卖点类型，不代表对未来价格走势的判断或收益承诺。" = "Bubble color, shade and size indicate signal direction, pattern strength and signal class. They do not represent a view on future prices or any promise of returns.";
"缠论结构随后续行情更新而调整，已显示的信号可能被修正或失效。" = "Chan structures are adjusted as new market data arrives; signals already shown may be revised or invalidated.";
