"类型确定性：一类 0.4（背驰，待验证）、二类 0.7（回落在价格密集区获得支撑）、三类 1.0（离开中枢后不回中枢，最强确认）。" = "Type certainty: type-1 0.4 (divergence, to be verified), type-2 0.7 (pullback holds in a price cluster), type-3 1.0 (left the pivot without returning, strongest confirmation).";
"所在的最后一笔还在走，端点可能延伸甚至回到中枢，按缠论尚不成立；这一笔走完才算买卖点。" = "The last stroke is still unfolding — its end may extend or even return to the pivot, so by Chan theory it is not yet a signal; it counts once this stroke completes.";
