"营收高速增长，但经营活动还没有产生正向现金流，扩张仍靠外部资金或账上存量支撑。营收基数为零、仍在烧钱的公司也归入这里。" = "Revenue is growing fast, but operations do not yet generate positive cash flow; expansion still relies on outside funding or cash on hand. Companies with no revenue base that are still burning cash are also placed here.";
"营收高速增长，且经营活动已经能产生现金。增长持续性、利润率能否随规模提升是这一阶段的常见观察点。" = "Revenue is growing fast and operations already generate cash. Common things to watch at this stage are how durable the growth is and whether margins improve with scale.";
