/* 基本面研究：护城河（Morningstar 框架） */
"护城河" = "Moat";
"评估中" = "Assessing";
"暂未覆盖" = "Not covered";
"主要威胁：" = "Main threats: ";
"只展示，不计入综合等级 · 依据 %@ 年报" = "Shown only, not in the composite grade · based on the %@ annual report";
"护城河是怎么评的" = "How the moat is assessed";
"护城河评级怎么来的" = "How the moat rating was reached";
"财务证据：回报率是否长期高于资金成本" = "Financial evidence: have returns stayed above the cost of capital?";
"和 Morningstar 一样分三档：宽护城河 = 优势大概率能维持 20 年以上；窄护城河 = 大概率能维持 10 年以上；无护城河 = 利润容易被竞争拉低。" = "Three tiers, as with Morningstar: wide moat = the advantage will likely last 20+ years; narrow moat = likely 10+ years; no moat = profits are easily competed away.";
"① 财务证据（%@）：" = "① Financial evidence (%@): ";
"② 年报里的来源：" = "② Sources in the annual report: ";
"宽 = 财务证据强 + 至少 1 个强来源（或 2 个中等来源）；窄 = 财务证据至少一般 + 至少 1 个中等以上来源；否则为无。来源再强，财务上长期跑不赢资金成本也不算有护城河。" = "Wide = strong financial evidence + at least 1 strong source (or 2 moderate); narrow = at least moderate evidence + at least 1 moderate-or-better source; otherwise none. However strong the sources, no moat if returns don't beat the cost of capital over time.";
"趋势「%@」：比较最近 3 年和最早 3 年的平均超额回报，相差超过 2 个百分点才算扩大或收窄。" = "Trend \"%@\": compares average excess returns in the latest 3 years with the earliest 3; a change of more than 2 points counts as widening or narrowing.";
"ROIC = 投进生意里的每 100 元一年赚回多少。只有长期高于资金成本（借钱和股东要求的回报），公司才是在创造价值。" = "ROIC = what each $100 put into the business earns in a year. A company only creates value if it stays above the cost of capital (the return lenders and shareholders require).";
"银行、保险等金融公司的投入资本口径不可比，这里用 ROE（股东每投入 100 元一年赚回多少）对比股权资金成本。" = "Invested capital isn't comparable for banks and insurers, so ROE (what each $100 of shareholder money earns a year) is compared with the cost of equity.";
"资金成本约 %@：按无风险利率 4.3%% + β × 股权风险溢价 5%% 估算（再与税后债务成本按市值 / 负债加权）。" = "Cost of capital about %@: risk-free rate 4.3%% + β × equity risk premium 5%%, weighted with the after-tax cost of debt by market value and debt.";
"财务证据强 = 至少 8 年数据、最多 1 年没跑赢、平均高出 3 个百分点以上；一般 = 至少 5 年、七成年份跑赢且平均为正。" = "Strong evidence = at least 8 years of data, at most 1 year below, and an average of 3+ points above; moderate = at least 5 years, 70% of years above, positive on average.";
"白线 = 资金成本" = "White line = cost of capital";
"年报原文" = "From the annual report";
"年报原文（%@ 10-K）" = "From the annual report (%@ 10-K)";
"无形资产：让客户愿意多付钱、或让对手进不来的品牌、专利、牌照。" = "Intangible assets: brands, patents or licenses that make customers pay more or keep rivals out.";
"转换成本：客户想换掉它，要付出很多钱、时间或风险。" = "Switching costs: customers would pay a lot in money, time or risk to replace it.";
"网络效应：用的人越多，对每个用户越有价值，比如支付网络、交易平台。" = "Network effect: the more people use it, the more valuable it is to each user — like payment networks or marketplaces.";
"成本优势：能比对手更便宜地做出同样的东西，而且长期如此。" = "Cost advantage: it can make the same thing more cheaply than rivals, for the long run.";
"有效规模：市场只容得下少数几家，新来的进来大家都不赚钱，比如管道、机场。" = "Efficient scale: the market only supports a few players; a newcomer would leave everyone unprofitable — like pipelines or airports.";

