"什么是基本面筛选" = "What is the fundamentals screen";
"雷达只画基本面靠前的股票的缠论结构信号：这是一个观察流程，先看市场和行业，再看哪些股票基本面靠前，最后看它们的缠论结构。" = "The radar only draws Chan structure signals of stocks with strong fundamentals. It is an observation flow: check the market and industry first, then which stocks have strong fundamentals, and finally their Chan structure.";
"基本面靠前 = 当前综合等级达标的股票。综合等级由估值、成长、盈利能力、动量、EPS 修正五个维度在同行业内的百分位平均得出，只给字母等级；任一维度为 F 时，综合等级最高 C+。" = "Strong fundamentals = a stock whose current composite grade meets the threshold. The grade averages the within-industry percentiles of five dimensions (valuation, growth, profitability, momentum, EPS revisions) and is shown as a letter only; if any dimension is F, the composite is capped at C+.";
"门槛随股票池自动调整：取有评级股票的前 25%，至少 8 只，且不低于 B，同一等级整档纳入。顶部流程图写着当前门槛「X 及以上」。" = "The threshold adapts to the stock pool: the top 25% of rated stocks, at least 8, and never below B; a whole grade is included at once. The flow chart at the top shows the current threshold \"X and above\".";
"用的是股票当前的等级，不是信号当天的；评级暂时读取失败时不做筛选，雷达照常显示全部信号。" = "The stock's current grade is used, not the grade on the signal day. If ratings cannot be read, no filtering is applied and the radar shows all signals.";
