"这是一个投资观察流程：先看市场和行业，再看基本面靠前的股票，最后看它们的缠论结构。内容仅为按规则整理的事实，不构成投资建议。" = "This is an observation flow, not advice: check the market and industry first, then stocks with strong fundamentals, and finally their Chan structure. Content is facts organized by rules and is not investment advice.";
