"进攻 − 防御（涨幅差）" = "Offense − Defense (return gap)";
"现金 − 风险资产（涨幅差）" = "Cash − Risk assets (return gap)";
"原料每天算一次，都看近 20 个交易日：纳指涨跌、纳指波动、VIX 恐慌指数，再加两个「资金流向」指标。进攻篮子 = 科技、可选消费、工业、半导体；防御篮子 = 公用事业、必需消费、医疗；现金篮子 = 短债；篮子内等权。" = "Inputs are computed daily over the last 20 trading days: Nasdaq return, Nasdaq volatility, the VIX, plus two \"money flow\" gauges. Offense basket = tech, discretionary, industrials, semiconductors; defense basket = utilities, staples, health care; cash basket = short-term Treasuries; each basket is equal-weighted.";
"原料每天算一次，都看近 20 个交易日：基准指数涨跌、基准波动、短期 / 长期波动比（这两个市场没有可用的波动率指数，用它代替 VIX），再加两个「资金流向」指标。进攻、防御、现金三个篮子都由等权的 ETF 组成。" = "Inputs are computed daily over the last 20 trading days: benchmark return, benchmark volatility, the short/long volatility ratio (these markets have no usable volatility index, so it stands in for the VIX), plus two \"money flow\" gauges. The offense, defense and cash baskets are equal-weighted ETFs.";
"先取五个原料" = "Start with five inputs";
"让模型把历史分成三种状态" = "Let a model split history into three states";
"用一个统计模型（隐马尔可夫模型）读历史上的五个原料，让它自己归纳出三种典型状态，不是我们预先划线。模型每个月最后一个交易日用截至当天的全部历史重新估计一次，之后一个月参数固定；当天只用当天及之前的数据，已经出的历史状态不会被未来数据改写。" = "A statistical model (a hidden Markov model) reads the five inputs over history and finds three typical states on its own; we do not draw the lines. On the last trading day of each month it is re-fitted on all history up to that day, then its parameters stay fixed for the next month. Each day only uses data up to that day, so published history is never rewritten by later data.";
"给三种状态命名" = "Name the three states";
"哪一种最像「大盘涨、波动小、恐慌指数低、资金追进攻、没往现金跑」，就叫逐利；最相反的叫避险；介于两者之间的叫观望。" = "The state closest to \"market up, low volatility, low fear index, money chasing offense, not fleeing to cash\" is called Risk-on; the opposite is Risk-off; the one in between is Neutral.";
"算今天更像哪一种" = "Which state does today look like";
"拿今天的五个原料去对照三种状态，给出各自的概率，加起来 100%。" = "Today's five inputs are compared with the three states, giving each a probability; they add up to 100%.";
"连续确认才算数" = "Confirmed only after it persists";
"为避免一天一变，同一种状态要连续 3 个交易日才算确认。现在的「%@」已持续 %lld 个交易日。" = "To avoid flipping day to day, a state counts only after it holds for 3 trading days in a row. The current \"%@\" has lasted %lld trading days.";
"当前判定：%@，概率 %@（%@ 收盘数据）" = "Current call: %@, probability %@ (close of %@)";
"概率只说「今天更像哪种历史状态」，不预测涨跌，也不是操作建议。模型把高波动当偏避险，急涨急跌的行情里可能和直觉不一致。" = "The probability only says which historical state today resembles. It does not predict returns and is not advice. The model treats high volatility as leaning risk-off, so sharp rallies or sell-offs may not match intuition.";
"这是一个 0~100 的合成指数" = "A composite index from 0 to 100";
"由市场动量、股价强度、上涨家数广度、期权看跌 / 看涨比、垃圾债需求、波动率、避险资产需求这七类公开指标，各自折算成 0~100 分后取平均。该指数由第三方公开发布，这里直接展示，不是我们自己算的。" = "It averages seven public gauges, each scaled to 0–100: market momentum, price strength, breadth, put/call ratio, junk-bond demand, volatility and safe-haven demand. The index is published by a third party and shown here as is; we do not compute it.";
"分数怎么分档" = "How scores are grouped";
"0~24 极度恐慌，25~44 恐慌，45~55 中性，56~75 贪婪，76~100 极度贪婪。" = "0–24 extreme fear, 25–44 fear, 45–55 neutral, 56–75 greed, 76–100 extreme greed.";
"和一周前、一月前比" = "Compared with a week and a month ago";
"同一个指数在不同时点的分数，看情绪是在升温还是降温。" = "The same index at different dates shows whether sentiment is warming or cooling.";
"当前 %lld 分：%@" = "Now %lld: %@";
"情绪看的是市场整体的冷暖，和「市场状态」（看资金流向）口径不同，下跌后的修复初期两者常常方向不一致，不是数据错误。" = "Sentiment measures the overall temperature of the market, while Market state looks at money flow. After a sell-off the two often disagree early in the recovery; that is not a data error.";
