"持平" = "Flat";
"判对股票的影响" = "Judge the effect on stocks";
"这是对环境的描述，不是预测或建议；五项各自独立判断，没有加总成一个分数。" = "This describes the environment; it is not a forecast or advice. The five items are judged independently and not combined into one score.";
"利率上行对股票偏不利（估值承压，成长股更敏感），下行偏有利，持平不判断。" = "Rising yields lean unfavorable for stocks (valuation pressure, growth stocks most sensitive), falling yields lean favorable; flat is not judged.";
"利差只描述形态（走阔 / 收窄）、不判断利弊；利差为负叫倒挂，会单独提示。" = "The spread only describes its shape (steepening / flattening) with no favorable or unfavorable call; a negative spread is called inverted and flagged separately.";
"美元走强偏不利（全球资金偏谨慎），走弱偏有利，持平不判断。" = "A stronger dollar leans unfavorable (global money turns cautious), a weaker dollar leans favorable; flat is not judged.";
"波动率上行偏不利（市场更紧张），回落偏有利，持平不判断。" = "Rising volatility leans unfavorable (markets more tense), falling volatility leans favorable; flat is not judged.";
"油价上涨偏不利（通胀压力上升），下跌偏有利，持平不判断。" = "Rising oil leans unfavorable (more inflation pressure), falling oil leans favorable; flat is not judged.";
"按固定规则判断对股票偏有利、偏不利还是中性，持平不判断。" = "A fixed rule decides whether it leans favorable, unfavorable or neutral; flat is not judged.";
"相对强弱 = 行业涨幅 − 大盘涨幅" = "Relative strength = sector return − market return";
"取近 20 个交易日，行业涨幅减去%@涨幅，大于 0 说明跑赢大盘，小于 0 说明落后。行业按它从强到弱排序。" = "Over the last 20 trading days, sector return minus the return of %@: above 0 means it beat the market, below 0 means it lagged. Sectors are ranked from strongest to weakest by this.";
"相对强弱" = "Relative strength";
"行业用对应的行业基金价格代表。" = "Each sector is represented by its sector fund.";
"行业没有干净的行业基金，用该行业市值最大的 8 只成分股等权合成一个指数代表。" = "There is no clean sector fund, so each sector is represented by an equal-weighted index of its 8 largest stocks by market cap.";
"行业状态：每个行业单独算" = "Sector state: computed per sector";
"%@每个行业单独跑一个和大盘同类的统计模型，原料是行业涨跌、波动、恐慌指标、相对大盘强弱和资金流（成交量加权的收盘位置）；输出逐利 / 观望 / 避险的概率，同样连续 3 个交易日才确认。" = "%@ Each sector runs its own statistical model of the same kind as the market one, using sector return, volatility, the fear gauge, relative strength and money flow (volume-weighted close position); it outputs Risk-on / Neutral / Risk-off probabilities and also needs 3 trading days in a row to confirm.";
"%@：相对大盘 %@" = "%@: %@ vs market";
"强弱是近 20 个交易日的相对表现，不预测后续涨跌，也不是操作建议。成分股很少的行业不出强弱。" = "Strength is relative performance over the last 20 trading days; it does not predict future moves and is not advice. Sectors with very few stocks get no strength reading.";
"怎么算的" = "How it's calculated";
"由进攻、防御、现金三组资产的相对强弱，加上大盘涨跌和波动综合判定，按概率给出；%@ 收盘数据。" = "Judged from the relative strength of offensive, defensive and cash assets plus the market's return and volatility, given as probabilities; close of %@.";
"市场状态怎么算的" = "How the market state is calculated";
"情绪分怎么算的" = "How the sentiment score is calculated";
"行业强弱怎么算的" = "How sector strength is calculated";
"先要有趋势" = "First, a trend";
"价格先走出至少两个依次下移、互不重叠的中枢（A 和 B），并已向下离开 B。" = "Price first forms at least two non-overlapping pivots stepping down (A and B) and has left B downward.";
"价格先走出至少两个依次上移、互不重叠的中枢（A 和 B），并已向上离开 B。" = "Price first forms at least two non-overlapping pivots stepping up (A and B) and has left B upward.";
"再比 b、c 两段的力度" = "Then compare the strength of legs b and c";
"b 段 = A 与 B 之间的那一段，c 段 = 离开 B 的这一段。各自把 MACD 红绿柱的面积相加，再用 c 段除以 b 段。" = "Leg b is the move between A and B; leg c is the move leaving B. Add up the MACD histogram area of each, then divide c by b.";
"面积比（c ÷ b）" = "Area ratio (c ÷ b)";
"创新低且面积更小 = 趋势背驰" = "New low with smaller area = trend divergence";
"创新高且面积更小 = 趋势背驰" = "New high with smaller area = trend divergence";
"c 段把价格推到新低，但面积比小于 100%，说明这一段下跌的力气比上一段小，这就是趋势背驰，一类买点成立的条件。" = "Leg c pushes price to a new low, but the area ratio is below 100%: this drop has less force than the previous one. That is trend divergence, the condition for a type-1 buy.";
"c 段把价格推到新高，但面积比小于 100%，说明这一段上涨的力气比上一段小，这就是趋势背驰，一类卖点成立的条件。" = "Leg c pushes price to a new high, but the area ratio is below 100%: this rally has less force than the previous one. That is trend divergence, the condition for a type-1 sell.";
"缠论原文只有「面积更小即背驰」，没有强弱分档，所以强弱统一标「中」。" = "The original theory only says \"smaller area means divergence\" with no strength tiers, so strength is always shown as medium.";
"走完再确认" = "Confirm after the stroke completes";
"这一笔走完、并且反方向的下一笔已经开始成形，才算成立，所以它比价格转折晚几天出现。后面如果价格继续创新极值，这个一类就作废。" = "It counts only once this stroke is finished and the next stroke in the opposite direction has started to form, so it appears a few days after the price turn. If price keeps making new extremes afterwards, this type-1 point is voided.";
"%@：趋势背驰，面积比 %@" = "%@: trend divergence, area ratio %@";
"%@：趋势背驰" = "%@: trend divergence";
"面积是累计值，c 段常比 b 段短，所以面积比容易偏小，时长比一并列在上面供对照。一类只是背驰迹象，不保证转折，也不是操作建议。" = "Area is a cumulative value and leg c is often shorter than leg b, so the ratio tends to be small; the duration ratio is listed above for reference. A type-1 point is only a sign of divergence, does not guarantee a turn and is not advice.";
"先有同方向的一类" = "First, a type-1 point in the same direction";
"二买要建立在一买之上，没有一买就没有二买。" = "A type-2 buy builds on a type-1 buy; without one there is no type-2 buy.";
"二卖要建立在一卖之上，没有一卖就没有二卖。" = "A type-2 sell builds on a type-1 sell; without one there is no type-2 sell.";
"一买后第一次回落不破一买低点" = "First pullback after the type-1 buy holds above its low";
"一卖后第一次反弹不过一卖高点" = "First rebound after the type-1 sell stays below its high";
"一买之后价格先反弹、再第一次回落，回落的低点没有跌破一买的低点，就是二买。" = "After the type-1 buy price rebounds, then pulls back for the first time; if the pullback low does not break the type-1 low, it is a type-2 buy.";
"一卖之后价格先回落、再第一次反弹，反弹的高点没有超过一卖的高点，就是二卖。" = "After the type-1 sell price drops, then rebounds for the first time; if the rebound high does not exceed the type-1 high, it is a type-2 sell.";
"%@：一类之后的第一次回落 / 反弹没有破极值" = "%@: first pullback / rebound after type-1 did not break the extreme";
"买卖点只是缠论对价格结构的一次观测，不预测涨跌，也不是操作建议。" = "A buy/sell point is only one observation of price structure by Chan rules; it does not predict returns and is not advice.";
"先离开中枢" = "First, leave the pivot";
"价格向上突破中枢区间并离开。" = "Price breaks above the pivot range and leaves it.";
"价格向下突破中枢区间并离开。" = "Price breaks below the pivot range and leaves it.";
"离开后第一次回落没有回到中枢" = "First pullback after leaving does not return to the pivot";
"离开后第一次反弹没有回到中枢" = "First rebound after leaving does not return to the pivot";
"回落的低点仍在中枢上沿之上，说明中枢上沿成了支撑，就是三买。" = "The pullback low stays above the top of the pivot, so the top acted as support: a type-3 buy.";
"反弹的高点仍在中枢下沿之下，说明中枢下沿成了压力，就是三卖。" = "The rebound high stays below the bottom of the pivot, so the bottom acted as resistance: a type-3 sell.";
"%@：离开中枢后的第一次回落 / 反弹没有回到中枢" = "%@: first pullback / rebound after leaving the pivot did not return";
"强弱怎么定" = "How strength is decided";
"看两件事：所靠中枢的级别（笔级、线段级，线段级更强），和回落（反弹）的落点离中枢边界有多远（越远越强）。两项加权后分强 / 中 / 弱。" = "Two things: the level of the pivot it relies on (stroke-level or segment-level, segment-level is stronger), and how far the pullback (rebound) ends from the pivot edge (farther is stronger). They are weighted into strong / medium / weak.";
"这个信号" = "This signal";
"一类是趋势背驰：趋势走出两个依次下移（一卖为上移）的中枢后，离开最后一个中枢的这一段创出新低（一卖为新高），MACD 红绿柱面积却比上一段小。" = "Type 1 is trend divergence: after a trend forms two pivots stepping down (up for a sell), the leg leaving the last pivot makes a new low (new high for a sell) while its MACD histogram area is smaller than the previous leg's.";
"二类是一类之后的第一次回落（二卖为反弹），没有跌破一买的低点（二卖为没有超过一卖的高点）；之前没有一类的不算。" = "Type 2 is the first pullback after a type-1 point (rebound for a sell) that does not break the type-1 buy low (does not exceed the type-1 sell high); without a type-1 point it does not count.";
"三类是价格离开中枢后的第一次回落（三卖为反弹），回落低点仍在中枢上沿之上、没有回到中枢（三卖反之）。" = "Type 3 is the first pullback after price leaves a pivot (rebound for a sell) whose low stays above the pivot's top without re-entering it (reverse for a sell).";
"面积比" = "Area ratio";
"%@ 怎么识别的" = "How %@ is identified";
"给每只股票一个综合等级" = "Give every stock a composite grade";
"估值、成长、盈利能力、动量、EPS 修正五个维度，每个维度是这只股票在同行业里的百分位（越靠前分越高），五项取平均，再对应到 A+ 到 F 共 13 档字母。任一维度为 F 时，综合等级最高 C+。点进个股详情的「基本面研究」能看到每一项。" = "Five dimensions: valuation, growth, profitability, momentum and EPS revisions. Each is the stock's percentile within its industry (higher is better). The five are averaged and mapped to 13 letter grades from A+ to F. If any dimension is F, the composite is capped at C+. Open the stock's Fundamentals page to see each item.";
"数一数有评级的股票" = "Count the rated stocks";
"只统计当前这个指数里已经有综合等级的股票。" = "Only stocks in this index that already have a composite grade are counted.";
"有评级的只数" = "Rated stocks";
"划线：取前 %@，至少 %lld 只" = "Draw the line: top %@, at least %lld";
"目标只数 = 有评级股票的前 %@（至少 %lld 只）。从最高等级往下累计各等级的只数，累计到达目标的那一档就是门槛；同一等级整档纳入、不在档内切；门槛不低于 %@，小池子或整体偏弱的池子不凑数。" = "Target = the top %@ of rated stocks (at least %lld). Counting down from the highest grade, the grade where the running total reaches the target is the threshold; a grade is included whole, never split; the threshold is never below %@, so small or weak pools are not padded.";
"目标只数" = "Target count";
"门槛" = "Threshold";
"%@ 及以上" = "%@ or above";
"达标只数" = "Qualifying stocks";
"只用当前等级" = "Only the current grade";
"用的是每只股票当前的等级，不是信号出现那天的；评级暂时读取失败时不做筛选，雷达照常显示全部信号。" = "Each stock's current grade is used, not the grade on the signal day. If ratings cannot be read, no filtering is applied and the radar shows every signal.";
"基本面：%lld 只达标，门槛 %@ 及以上" = "Fundamentals: %lld qualify, threshold %@ or above";
"基本面靠前只是缩小观察范围，不是推荐名单，也不预测涨跌。门槛随股票池大小自动调整，不同指数的门槛不一样。" = "Strong fundamentals only narrow what you look at; it is not a recommendation list and does not predict returns. The threshold adapts to the pool size, so it differs by index.";
"先定大级别的方向" = "First, set the higher-level direction";
"取日线的形态倾向：由末笔方向、线段方向、中枢位置、背驰、量价这几项各给一个正负分，加权相加；总分够大偏多，够小偏空，居中算僵持。" = "The daily structure bias: stroke direction, segment direction, pivot position, divergence and volume each get a signed score, weighted and added; a large enough total leans up, a small enough one leans down, in between is a standoff.";
"再看小级别近期的买卖点" = "Then look at recent points on the lower level";
"在 30 分钟线上，找最近两个交易日出现的买卖点；同时有买点和卖点时，以最新的一个为准。" = "On the 30-minute chart, find buy/sell points from the last two trading days; if there are both, the latest one counts.";
"对一对方向" = "Compare the directions";
"日线偏多、30 分钟又出现买点（或日线偏空、30 分钟出现卖点），方向一致，叫「共振」；方向相反叫「逆势」；30 分钟还没有买卖点、或日线方向僵持，叫「等待」；30 分钟数据取不到叫「不可用」。" = "Daily leaning up with a 30-minute buy (or daily leaning down with a 30-minute sell) means the directions agree: \"aligned\". Opposite directions are \"counter-trend\". No 30-minute point yet, or a daily standoff, is \"waiting\". If 30-minute data is missing it is \"unavailable\".";
"共振 = 日线方向和 30 分钟买卖点一致" = "Aligned = daily direction agrees with the 30-minute point";
"共振只说两个级别方向一致，不表示后续一定上涨或下跌。盘中每 30 分钟刷新一次。" = "Aligned only says the two levels agree; it does not mean the price will necessarily rise or fall. It refreshes every 30 minutes during the session.";
"取近 90 天的评级变动" = "Take rating changes of the last 90 days";
"只看券商对这只股票的评级调整：上调（比如从中性调到买入）和下调，维持原评级不算。" = "Only brokers' rating changes on this stock count: upgrades (e.g. neutral to buy) and downgrades; reiterations do not.";
"相减得到净值" = "Subtract to get the net";
"净值 = 上调家数 − 下调家数。大于 0 画「▲n」（红），小于 0 画「▼n」（绿），等于 0 或没有数据就不画。" = "Net = upgrades − downgrades. Above 0 shows \"▲n\" (red), below 0 shows \"▼n\" (green); 0 or no data shows nothing.";
"只做美股" = "US stocks only";
"A 股的研报没有上调 / 下调字段，港股只有各券商最新的评级，所以这个角标只对美股显示。" = "A-share reports have no upgrade/downgrade field and for Hong Kong only each broker's latest rating is available, so this badge appears for US stocks only.";
"角标 = 近 90 天券商净上调 / 净下调家数" = "Badge = net broker upgrades / downgrades in the last 90 days";
"只是评级调整次数的事实陈列，不代表评级对错，也不预测涨跌。" = "It only lists how many rating changes happened; it does not judge whether they are right and does not predict returns.";
"一类：统一标「中」" = "Type 1: always medium";
"一类是趋势背驰。缠论原文只有「面积更小即背驰」，没有强弱分档；我们用两个年代约 2000 个信号检验过，面积比和后续收益没有关系，所以不再分档，一律标「中」。" = "Type 1 is trend divergence. The original theory only says \"smaller area means divergence\" with no strength tiers; we tested about 2,000 signals from two eras and the area ratio showed no relation to later returns, so there are no tiers and it is always medium.";
"二、三类：按中枢和落点定" = "Types 2 and 3: by pivot and landing point";
"看所靠中枢的级别（线段级比笔级强），和回落（反弹）的落点离中枢边界有多远（越远越强），两项加权后分强 / 中 / 弱。" = "The level of the pivot it relies on (segment-level is stronger than stroke-level) and how far the pullback (rebound) ends from the pivot edge (farther is stronger); the two are weighted into strong / medium / weak.";
"颜色深浅" = "Color depth";
"红买绿卖不变，强弱只改颜色的深浅：越强越深，越弱越浅。" = "Red for buy and green for sell never change; strength only changes the shade: stronger is darker, weaker is lighter.";
"深浅 = 信号强弱（强 / 中 / 弱）" = "Shade = signal strength (strong / medium / weak)";
"强弱描述的是这个结构自身的坚决程度，不是预期收益的大小。" = "Strength describes how decisive the structure itself is, not the size of expected returns.";
"深浅怎么算" = "How shade is set";
"共振怎么算" = "How alignment works";
"角标怎么算" = "How badges work";
"基本面怎么算的" = "How fundamentals are decided";
"市场环境" = "Market conditions";
"结构信号" = "Structure signals";
"通用概念" = "General concepts";
"显示专业数值" = "Show technical figures";
"重看新手导览" = "Replay the quick tour";
"打开后，买卖点详情里会多出面积比、价差比、时长比等专业数值；点「怎么识别的」随时能看到它们是什么。" = "When on, buy/sell point details also show technical figures such as area, price and duration ratios; tap 'How it's identified' any time to see what they are.";
"新手入门" = "Beginner primer";
"没学过金融也能读：先弄明白这个 App 的思路，再一步步看懂每个数字。" = "No finance background needed: first understand the idea behind this app, then see what each number means step by step.";
"30 秒看懂这个 App" = "Understand this app in 30 seconds";
"重新看一遍新手导览" = "Watch the quick tour again";
"以上为知识讲解，仅供学习参考，不构成投资建议。" = "The above is educational explanation for reference only and is not investment advice.";
"名词小词典" = "Glossary";
"逐利、避险、基点、倒挂、百分位……一查就懂" = "Risk-on, risk-off, basis points, inversion, percentile… look it up and get it";
"从大到小看市场" = "Look at the market from big to small";
"先看市场，再看行业，再看公司基本面，最后看价格走势的结构。四步连起来，才是一幅完整的画面。" = "Market first, then industry, then company fundamentals, and finally the structure of the price path. Put together, the four steps give the full picture.";
"顶部：市场和行业" = "Top: market and industry";
"顶部的卡片告诉你大盘现在是「逐利、观望还是避险」，行业横条告诉你哪些行业更强。点开都能看到数字是怎么算的。" = "The top card tells you whether the market is risk-on, neutral or risk-off, and the industry strip shows which industries are stronger. Open either to see how the numbers are calculated.";
"中间：雷达上的气泡" = "Middle: bubbles on the radar";
"每个气泡是一只股票近期出现的一个结构信号。红色是买点类、绿色是卖点类，颜色越深结构越清晰，越靠中心越新。它描述走势位置，不是买卖指令。" = "Each bubble is a structure signal that recently appeared on a stock. Red is buy-type and green is sell-type; a deeper shade means a clearer structure and closer to the center means newer. It describes a position on the path; it is not a trade order.";
"雷达只画基本面靠前的股票，名单里能看到它们的综合等级。基本面好不等于股价会涨，它更像一道过滤，帮你缩小范围。" = "The radar only draws stocks with strong fundamentals, and the list shows their composite grades. Good fundamentals do not mean the price will rise; they work as a filter to narrow your scope.";
"看不懂就点问号" = "Tap the question mark when unsure";
"每个数字旁的「怎么算的」会一步步讲推导，不认识的词点旁边的问号，学习页里还有新手入门和名词小词典。理解之后，决定由你来做。" = "'How it's calculated' beside each number walks through the derivation step by step; tap the question mark next to unfamiliar words. The Learn tab also has a beginner primer and a glossary. Once you understand, the decision is yours.";
"以上内容仅为知识讲解和事实陈列，不构成投资建议。" = "The above is educational explanation and a record of facts and is not investment advice.";
"下一步" = "Next";
"开始使用" = "Get started";
"跳过" = "Skip";
"这个词是什么意思" = "What does this word mean";
"举个例子" = "For example";
"它不代表" = "It does not mean";
"以上为通俗解释，仅供学习参考，不构成投资建议。" = "The above is a plain-language explanation for reference only and is not investment advice.";
"搜索名词" = "Search terms";
"这说明" = "This tells you";
"这不说明" = "This does not tell you";
